    <heroContent>
      <Value><![CDATA[<p><strong>Get service on demand for concrete, asphalt, soils and aggregate testing.</strong></p>
<p>Our on-site laboratories and skilled technicians can provide reliable, accurate results for all your long-term geotechnical and material testing needs.</p>
<p>Our tests always adhere strictly to standards set by SANAS, ASTM and more.</p>]]></Value>
